    "problems": "The measured units are learned SAE features rather than model neurons or neuron poles. The monosemanticity pipeline relies on automated model-generated summaries and SigLip2 semantic embeddings. The text does not report uncertainty estimates for the Table 1 or Table 2 results.",
    "rows_left_out": "Figure 5 gives additional layer-wise mIoU, explained-variance, and active-feature results mainly as plots, without extractable layer-specific values in the text; only the explicitly stated layer-15 mIoU comparison was retained. Omitted reconstruction, sparsity, pipeline identification-rate, and clustering silhouette results because they do not measure the claim's neuron-level subject.",
